{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-62313","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93923","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-62314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93924","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-93925","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-93926","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-93927","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-93928","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-93929","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-62315","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93930","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-62316","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93931","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-93932","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-93933","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-62317","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93934","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-93935","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-62318","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93936","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-93937","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-93938","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-62319","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-62320","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93939","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-93940","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-93941","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-62321","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93942","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-62322","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-62323","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93943","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-62324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93944","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-93945","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-93946","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-62325","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-62326","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93947","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-62327","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93948","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-62328","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62330","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93949","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-93950","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView"}]}],"id":"blk-62329","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62332","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93951","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-93952","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]}],"id":"blk-62331","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-62333","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62335","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93953","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-93954","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-62334","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62337","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93955","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-93956","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-62336","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62339","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93957","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-93958","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-62338","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62341","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93959","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-93960","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-62340","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62343","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93961","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-62342","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-62344","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62346","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93962","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-93963","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-93964","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-93965","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-62345","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-62347","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62349","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93966","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-62348","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62351","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93967","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-62350","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93968","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-62352","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-62354","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62356","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93969","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]}],"id":"blk-62355","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-62357","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62359","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93970","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-93971","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-62358","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62361","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93972","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-93973","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-62360","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62363","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93974","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-93975","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-62362","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62365","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93976","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-93977","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-62364","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-62366","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93978","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-62367","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62369","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93979","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-93980","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-93981","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-93982","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-62368","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-62370","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93983","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-62371","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93984","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-93985","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-62373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93986","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-62375","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-62377","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62379","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93987","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-93988","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-93989","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-93990","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-62378","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-62380","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93991","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-62381","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62384","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93992","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-62383","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93993","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-62385","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62388","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93994","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-62387","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93995","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-62389","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93996","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-62391","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-62393","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-93997","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-93998","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],"id":"blk-62394","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-62396","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-93999","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-62397","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94000","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-94001","text":" (section 8)"}]}],"id":"blk-62398","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-62400","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62402","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94002","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-62401","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62404","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94003","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-62403","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62406","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94004","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-94005","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-62405","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62408","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94006","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-62407","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-62409","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-94007","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-62410","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62412","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94008","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-94009","text":" (section 6)"}]}],"id":"blk-62411","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-62413","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62415","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94010","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-62414","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62417","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94011","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-62416","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62419","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94012","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-62418","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-62420","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94013","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-94014","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes"}]}],"id":"blk-62421","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94015","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-94016","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]}],"id":"blk-62423","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-62425","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-94017","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-62426","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94018","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-94019","text":" (section 7)"}]}],"id":"blk-62427","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-62429","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-62431","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-94020","text":"Permission r